alysis.\n    *   The plan is generated based on the retrieved data and can take various forms, such as a summary, a report, or a visualization.\n*   **Chat with PDF**\n    *   The Chat with PDF feature allows users to engage in a conversational interface with the NeMo Retriever, asking questions or providing input related to a specific PDF document.\n    *   The system responds with relevant information and insights extracted from the PDF, facilitating a more interactive and engaging experience.\n*   **NVIDIA L4 Tensor", 'similarity score': 0.5759345889091492}, {'frames/frame_1808': 'frames/frame_1808', 'text': 'Jensen Huang, a 61-year-old Taiwanese-American businessman and the founder, CEO, and president of Nvidia, stands on a dark stage, gesturing with his right hand as he presents a large computer chip and a slide with white text that reads "MARCH 18, 2024 ANNOUNCING NVIDIA BLACKWELL PLATFORM FOR TRILLION-PARAMETER SCALE GENERATIVE AI" and six icons with accompanying text describing the features of the Nvidia Blackwell platform.', 'similarity score': 0.5759332180023193}, {'frames/frame_2996': 'frames/frame_2996', 'text': 'Jensen Huang, CEO of NVIDIA, is giving a presentation at an event on March 18, 2024, as indicated by the text in the top-right corner of the image.', 'similarity score': 0.5751311779022217}, {'frames/frame_3040': 'frames/frame_3040', 'text': 'Jensen Huang, the CEO of NVIDIA, stands on a stage, holding a smartphone and addressing the audience during a presentation on March 18, 2024.', 'similarity score': 0.5748441219329834}, {'5745': '5745', 'text': 'frames/frame_5750 seconds: The image presents a flowchart illustrating the process of data processing and analysis, with a focus on NVIDIA Omniverse Cloud. The chart is divided into several sections, each representing a different stage in the process.\n\n*   **Prompt**\n    *   The flowchart begins with a "Prompt" section, which is connected to three subsequent sections: Edify, ChatUSD, and DeepSearc