ase that stores vector representations of data.\\n            *   Utilizes RAPIDS cuVS for accelerated indexing and nearest neighbor search.\\n        *   **Embedding Microservices**: Services responsible for generating embeddings for different data types.\\n            *   Supports text, documents, PDFs, and images.\\n        *   **Retrieval Microservices**: Services that facilitate the retrieval of relevant information.\\n            *   Enables the retrieval of information from various data sources.\\n        *   **Text-to-SQL Microservice**: A service that converts text queries into SQL queries.\\n            *   Allows users to query databases using natural language.\\n        *   **Plan**: A component that generates a plan for executing queries.\\n            *   Coordinates the execution of queries across different microservices.\\n*   **Chat with PDF**\\n    *   The system enables users to engage in conversations with PDFs.\\n    *   Features a user interface that displays a chat window and a graph showing the performance of the NVIDIA L4 Tensor Core GPU.\\n    *   Statistics:\\n        *   The NVIDIA L4 Tensor Core GPU outperforms other GPUs in terms of inference speed.\\n        *   The graph shows the L4 inference speedups compared to other GPUs.\\n\\nIn summary, the NeMo Retriever is a powerful system that enables the retrieval of information from diverse data sources and facilitates conversations with PDFs. Its components work together to provide a seamless user experience, leveraging advanced technologies such as RAPIDS cuVS and NVIDIA L4 Tensor Core GPU.",\n    "similarity score": 0.5841299295425415\n  },\n  {\n    "4988": "4988",\n    "text": "frames/frame_4993 seconds: The image presents a comprehensive overview of the NeMo Retriever, a cutting-edge technology designed to facilitate efficient data retrieval and processing. The diagram is divided into several sections, each highlighting a distinct aspect of the NeMo Retriever\'s capabilities.\\n\\n* 